    "Practice Example: You have a list of sequence identifiers\n",
    "    samples = [\"sample_01\", \"control_02\", \"sample_03\", \"control_04\", \"sample_05\"]\n",
    "Complete the following tasks:\n",
    "    1. Use a list comprehension to filter out only the entries that start with \"sample_\". \n",
    "    2. Convert those filtered strings to upper case using .upper(). \n",
    "    3. Create a dictionary that pairs each formatted sample name with an initial quality score of 99."
   ]
 {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1a5fcfc1-e92c-4717-ad64-47fa74248678",
